From: Jordan Bayles <jophba@chromium.org>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 20:31:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [WIP] Prototype Web Tempo Sync API (navigator.tempoSync)

Prototypes the Web Tempo Sync API behind --enable-blink-features=TempoSync
and --tempo-sync-engine=rust, bridging Blink to the sans-IO tempo_sync_core
Rust engine over Mojo and cxx.

Bug: 576996348
